<title>FINLAND: Tamrock sees Q1 profit despite patent fine.</title>
<headline>Tamrock sees Q1 profit despite patent fine.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering group Tamrock Oy said on Monday it expected to make a profit in the first quarter although it had been fined $16.2 million in a U.S. patent dispute .</p>
<p>&quot;Despite the compensation and other costs related to the patent dispute Tamrock's result for the first quarter in 1997 is expected to be profitable,&quot; Tamrock said in a statement.</p>
</text>
